From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:33:23 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] config: enable ordinary subresource loading by default

Enable image, dedicated/shared worker and external stylesheet loading by
default alongside the iframe default from the previous patch. Reuse the
existing native implementations and preserve per-context opt-outs through
LP.configureLoading. Leave experimental service workers disabled.

Update CLI help and deprecated-option warnings for the new defaults. Clarify
that image loading reads at most a 16 KiB prefix for supported dimensions,
without decoding or rendering image pixels.

Keep placeholder URL/property fixtures explicitly in no-fetch mode; existing
image and external stylesheet fetch tests continue to exercise network
loading. Update the existing CDP stylesheet-default expectation. Add no new
unit tests and leave the benchmark unchanged.

The worker-enabled diagnostic changed four benchmark failures to passes
without synthetic worker objects or benchmark-specific interception. The
extra requests, script execution and CSS parsing are intentional fidelity
costs; performance measurement is deferred.
---
 src/Config.zig                            | 10 +++++-----
 src/browser/tests/element/html/image.html |  2 +-
 src/browser/tests/element/html/link.html  |  6 +++---
 src/browser/webapi/element/html/Image.zig |  4 ++--
 src/browser/webapi/element/html/Link.zig  |  2 +-
 src/help.zon                              | 10 ++++++----
 src/server/cdp/domains/lp.zig             |  5 +++--
 7 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

